## 7) Frozen interactions (Option B)

### 7.1 Universal gauge-kinetic dressing

\[
S_{\mathrm{gauge}}=\int d^4x\,\sqrt{-g}\left[
-\frac{1}{4}\,Z(\Phi)\sum_{A\in\{B,W,G\}}F^A_{\mu\nu}F^{A\,\mu\nu}
\right]
\]

Frozen linear form:
\[
Z(\Phi)=1+c_g\frac{\Phi}{M_{\mathrm{Pl}}}
\]

### 7.2 Universal Yukawa dressing

\[
S_{\mathrm{yuk}}=\int d^4x\,\sqrt{-g}\left[
-\sum_f\left(y_f^{(0)}\,Y(\Phi)\,\bar{\psi}_f H \psi_f + \mathrm{h.c.}\right)
\right]
\]

Frozen linear form:
\[
Y(\Phi)=1+c_y\frac{\Phi}{M_{\mathrm{Pl}}}
\]

**Universality rule (v0.1):**
- no per-gauge-group \(c_{g1},c_{g2},c_{g3}\)
- no per-fermion \(c_{y,f}\)

