## 8) Memory kernel term (Logosfield recursion)

### 8.1 Nonlocal quadratic form (action-level)

\[
S_{\mathrm{mem}}=\frac{\gamma}{2}\int d^4x\,d^4x'\,\sqrt{-g}\,\sqrt{-g'}\,
\Phi(x)\,K_\beta(x,x')\,\Phi(x')
\]

### 8.2 Kernel family (frozen v0.1)

The kernel is **retarded/causal in the EOM**:

\[
K_\beta(t,t') \propto e^{-\beta(t-t')}\,\Theta(t-t')
\]

No additional kernel-shape parameters beyond **β** and **γ** are introduced in v0.1.

### 8.3 Stable auxiliary-field implementation (recommended)

Define:
\[
\Psi(t,\mathbf{x})=\int_{-\infty}^{t}\beta\,e^{-\beta(t-t')}\Phi(t',\mathbf{x})\,dt'
\]

Then:
\[
\dot{\Psi}=-\beta\Psi+\beta\Phi
\]

Stable discrete update:
\[
\Psi_{n+1}=\Psi_n e^{-\beta\Delta t}+\Phi_n(1-e^{-\beta\Delta t})
\]

