## 9) Full frozen action (v0.1)

\[
S = S_{\mathrm{GR}} + S_{\Phi} + S_{\mathrm{SM}} + S_{\mathrm{gauge}} + S_{\mathrm{yuk}} + S_{\mathrm{mem}}
\]

Equivalently, the local Lagrangian density (excluding the explicitly nonlocal \(S_{\mathrm{mem}}\)) is:

\[
\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{local}}
=
\frac{M_{\mathrm{Pl}}^2}{2}R
-\frac{1}{2}(\nabla\Phi)^2
- V(\Phi)
+\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{SM}}
-\frac{1}{4}Z(\Phi)\sum_{A}F^A_{\mu\nu}F^{A\,\mu\nu}
-\sum_f\left(y_f^{(0)}Y(\Phi)\bar{\psi}_f H\psi_f+\mathrm{h.c.}\right)
\]

